WEBVTT

00:17.330 --> 00:18.830
GHOST BUSTERZ!

00:17.710 --> 00:20.460
OH! The time has come

00:18.250 --> 00:18.830
BUSTERZ!

00:20.460 --> 00:23.840
To stand up for tomorrow

00:22.790 --> 00:24.250
OH OH OH!

00:23.840 --> 00:26.420
We're ghostbusterz

00:25.710 --> 00:27.220
OH OH OH!

00:26.420 --> 00:31.050
Breakin' away from the old ghosts

00:31.050 --> 00:34.430
Of history

00:34.430 --> 00:37.810
Breaking free!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!!

01:03.880 --> 01:05.380
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:04.250 --> 01:07.010
OH! The time has come

01:04.790 --> 01:05.380
BUSTERZ!

01:12.260 --> 01:13.760
OH OH OH!

01:13.300 --> 01:17.100
No fear for anything in our way!

01:15.560 --> 01:17.060
GHOST BUSTERZ!

01:15.640 --> 01:20.440
Presented by Strelizia subs

01:32.820 --> 01:37.040
The seventh month of 1600 AD, or Keicho 5.

01:37.410 --> 01:41.210
Charging Tokugawa Ieyasu with thirteen articles of impeachment,

01:41.210 --> 01:48.130
Ishida Mitsunari sent messengers to various daimyo in the name of the Toyotomi clan,

01:48.130 --> 01:51.300
telling them to raise armies.

01:51.300 --> 01:56.390
At the same time, beings seeking to end the period of turbulence

01:56.390 --> 02:00.270
and build a kingdom to last a thousand years

02:00.270 --> 02:04.520
were about to awaken from a thousand-year sleep.

02:04.520 --> 02:06.520
And then...

02:06.520 --> 02:10.280
On the fifteenth day of the ninth month, at Sekigahara,

02:10.280 --> 02:12.740
the Eastern Army of Tokugawa Ieyasu clashed with

02:12.740 --> 02:17.870
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and Ishida Mitsunari.

02:17.870 --> 02:21.330
As a result of the performance of Kobayakawa Hideaki's troops,

02:21.330 --> 02:27.250
the Western Army of the Toyotomi clan and
Ishida Mitsunari achieved a sweeping victory,

02:27.250 --> 02:33.510
bringing what should have been
three hundred years of peace to the world.

02:34.340 --> 02:39.390
You should all be quite familiar with this story...

02:46.600 --> 02:49.800
SASUKE SARUTOBI

03:24.360 --> 03:25.900
Watch out!

03:26.400 --> 03:27.880
No!

03:37.740 --> 03:39.070
How is that possible?

03:39.570 --> 03:41.370
Did Yume do that?

03:56.720 --> 04:00.180
Princess Yume...
I was careless.

04:00.970 --> 04:06.810
I was so distracted by
Kaguya that I forgot about her.

04:06.980 --> 04:12.190
Or rather, I remembered her too late...

04:12.360 --> 04:15.610
because she erased
her existence herself.

04:17.860 --> 04:21.660
Regardless, this is now interesting.

04:28.540 --> 04:31.540
A mechanical puppet!

04:41.430 --> 04:45.770
Only one person is capable
of making such puppets....

04:58.110 --> 05:00.070
Where am I going?

05:02.370 --> 05:04.330
Mitsunari Ishida's castle.

05:06.660 --> 05:08.250
Oh yes, I remember now.

05:08.410 --> 05:11.290
It happened before we met.

05:11.460 --> 05:14.130
I don't know why, but Mitsunari Ishida...

05:14.290 --> 05:22.340
asked me to fill his renovated
castle with traps against thieves.

05:23.930 --> 05:26.970
Of course I accepted it.

05:27.140 --> 05:30.390
My motto is to always be inventing.

05:31.600 --> 05:36.020
I would gladly sell my soul
to the ayakashi for that goal!

05:38.860 --> 05:42.320
Don't get mad!
We inventors are like that!

05:45.240 --> 05:46.570
You're right.

05:46.570 --> 05:51.660
This famous castle seems to
have been invaded by thieves...

05:51.830 --> 05:56.090
who destroyed some of
my inventions inside of it.

05:57.040 --> 06:05.890
I put sensors inside them that
warn me when they are destroyed.

06:16.230 --> 06:18.650
I have to repair them.

06:18.820 --> 06:22.030
That's why I'm going to the castle.

06:48.050 --> 06:50.180
Princess Yume... did you do that?

06:51.350 --> 06:57.100
No matter what powers you have,
this gun is more powerful.

06:57.730 --> 06:59.040
Prepare yourself!

07:00.230 --> 07:01.530
Yukimura Sanada!

07:04.570 --> 07:05.800
That's enough!

07:06.200 --> 07:08.240
Stay out of this, Musashi!

07:08.820 --> 07:13.580
I promised you I'd return
the gun to you in gift wrap...

07:13.750 --> 07:16.210
after I'm done killing that traitor Ishida!

07:16.710 --> 07:18.020
You need to wait!

07:18.420 --> 07:22.000
Stop joking around!
It's my gun!

07:22.170 --> 07:26.340
Also, I hate when people kill with guns!

07:27.010 --> 07:28.970
Then you're not worthy of having one!

07:29.470 --> 07:33.890
Shut up!
Give my gun back, now!

07:35.180 --> 07:36.100
Musashi!

07:36.980 --> 07:38.940
Give me back the demon gun!

07:40.610 --> 07:42.900
Do you want it back?
Very well.

07:43.320 --> 07:44.900
But you'll only get the bullets!

07:49.490 --> 07:50.620
No!

07:55.040 --> 07:56.580
Don't interfere!

08:19.350 --> 08:20.940
I've changed my mind.

08:21.060 --> 08:25.570
You are now all part of my plan of revenge.

08:25.740 --> 08:28.900
Accordingly, I will kill you all!

08:40.540 --> 08:43.380
Kobayakawa!
Pull yourself together!

08:44.340 --> 08:46.380
Kobayakawa!
Are you crazy?

08:47.050 --> 08:52.720
I get that you hate me, but Yume and
Kaguya have nothing to do with it!

08:54.470 --> 08:56.180
Die! Die! Die!

08:57.060 --> 08:59.140
Go to hell, all of you!

08:59.850 --> 09:00.640
It's useless!

09:00.850 --> 09:04.070
His heart is at the mercy of the demon!

09:04.570 --> 09:05.900
The demon?

09:06.070 --> 09:07.940
Master Takuan was right!

09:08.530 --> 09:15.410
Men overcome by the demon of the gun
lose their humanity, becoming demons!

09:15.580 --> 09:17.240
Kaguya, Sanada!

09:17.790 --> 09:20.250
Stay close to me!

09:21.620 --> 09:26.050
Yume, do you remember your powers?

09:26.710 --> 09:30.380
I don't know how, but I feel...

09:30.550 --> 09:33.300
I feel that I have an important mission.

09:34.260 --> 09:37.680
That's the only thing I know for sure.

09:38.270 --> 09:40.850
What kind of important mission?

09:41.690 --> 09:45.190
I must protect Musashi!

09:47.400 --> 09:49.240
Shouldn't it be the other way around?

09:49.690 --> 09:54.620
I could understand it if
Musashi had to protect you...

09:55.370 --> 09:57.280
No, I'm not sure about that.

09:57.450 --> 10:01.960
I have to protect Musashi,
and that's why I'm here.

10:21.810 --> 10:22.730
Amazing!

10:26.650 --> 10:30.360
To protect Musashi?

10:42.290 --> 10:45.250
Come on, stop yelling, Sasuke Sarutobi.

10:49.250 --> 10:53.090
I know you, you're the leader of the ayakashi.

10:53.260 --> 10:55.110
I haven't seen you in a while!

10:55.510 --> 10:57.600
No, we met at Daitokuji.

10:57.800 --> 10:59.930
At Daitokuji?

11:00.760 --> 11:07.690
I used the spider-queen to get rid of
Musashi, and yet, you helped him...

11:07.860 --> 11:12.070
and he even got his
hands on the demon gun.

11:13.440 --> 11:15.990
I had no chance of winning.

11:17.570 --> 11:19.740
So were you watching from a distance?

11:20.200 --> 11:21.990
I saw it all.

11:22.580 --> 11:27.710
That's not very fair,
you could have said hello.

11:28.210 --> 11:30.710
I could, but...

11:32.380 --> 11:34.120
It didn't seem appropriate.

11:34.260 --> 11:38.390
Correct, I did abstain from doing that.

11:39.220 --> 11:42.100
Mr. Leonardo da Vinci.

11:45.240 --> 11:48.990
I don't care about Mitsuda
and the shogunate!

11:49.160 --> 11:51.450
I'm gonna kill everyone on Earth!

11:52.660 --> 11:54.450
There is no escape like that!

11:54.620 --> 11:57.540
I absolutely need to get the gun back!

11:58.000 --> 12:04.670
Even if you recover the demon gun,
Kobayakawa will remain a demon.

12:05.260 --> 12:07.970
And he will die as one.
I cannot accept that!

12:08.550 --> 12:10.510
But what can I do about that?

12:10.680 --> 12:13.760
I told him not to touch the gun!

12:14.180 --> 12:20.520
But Kobayakawa has done you a
favor that you must repay, Musashi!

12:21.940 --> 12:23.240
Really?

12:23.610 --> 12:29.490
That's why he needs to find his human heart.

12:29.660 --> 12:32.160
- But how?
- I...

12:32.700 --> 12:34.870
- Mr. da Vinci.
- What?

12:35.040 --> 12:36.700
What are you doing?

12:37.080 --> 12:40.370
My mechanical puppets were broken.

12:40.500 --> 12:45.550
I came here to take them
back to repair them.

12:45.750 --> 12:50.130
So you are the one who manufactured them.

12:50.880 --> 12:52.680
My apologies.

12:52.850 --> 12:54.850
I destroyed one myself.

12:55.350 --> 12:56.560
That's okay.

12:56.720 --> 12:59.940
After all, I owe you a lot.

13:00.100 --> 13:02.650
And you, Yasha, why are you here?

13:04.650 --> 13:09.570
Right now, there is an interesting
performance taking place at the castle.

13:09.820 --> 13:11.410
I'm just watching it.

13:11.570 --> 13:14.200
A play?
And who are the actors?

13:15.080 --> 13:16.410
Ayakashi?

13:16.740 --> 13:21.210
No, for once, we have nothing to do with it.

13:21.370 --> 13:26.170
First, there's the hero
of the battle of Sekigahara,

13:26.670 --> 13:28.130
Hideaki Kobayakawa.

13:28.550 --> 13:31.550
I seem to remember he was a handsome boy.

13:32.010 --> 13:35.350
Next there are princesses Kaguya and Yume.

13:35.760 --> 13:36.930
Princess Yume?

13:37.680 --> 13:39.890
Don't you know her?

13:40.060 --> 13:44.440
She is originally from the same
place as Princess Kaguya.

13:46.770 --> 13:49.400
The same place as Princess Kaguya?

13:49.570 --> 13:51.360
Then there are Musashi and Ronin.

13:52.820 --> 13:54.240
Musashi again?

13:56.910 --> 13:59.500
What's the matter, Sasuke Sarutobi?

14:00.790 --> 14:02.710
What are you smiling like that for?

14:07.960 --> 14:10.340
Sanada's coat of arms.

14:10.670 --> 14:12.970
Yes, I had forgotten about that.

14:13.130 --> 14:17.810
There's also Yukimura Sanada
and some of his warriors.

14:19.390 --> 14:20.560
Very good.

14:34.570 --> 14:37.870
Is it over?
What a waste of time!

14:38.830 --> 14:40.250
What is Musashi doing?

14:48.920 --> 14:51.590
Dabinoji?
What is he doing there?

14:52.420 --> 14:53.920
Yasha is there too!

14:55.340 --> 14:57.430
What are they doing together?

14:58.010 --> 15:03.020
What kind of play is it?

15:03.310 --> 15:08.310
Kobayakawa tricked Musashi and
stole the demon gun from him.

15:08.690 --> 15:11.440
That does sound exciting!

15:11.610 --> 15:13.570
And what happened to Kobayakawa?

15:14.150 --> 15:18.200
He was defeated by the gun
demon and lost his humanity.

15:18.740 --> 15:21.030
The same as in real history, I guess.

15:23.620 --> 15:30.960
He originally sided with the West,
but betrayed them to let the East win.

15:31.590 --> 15:41.260
He had full appreciation of Tokugawa
shogunate, but society saw him as a villain.

15:41.430 --> 15:44.890
He eventually lost his humanity and died.

15:45.100 --> 15:47.440
That's what happened in real history.

15:49.560 --> 15:51.940
That's so weird!

15:52.070 --> 15:59.410
Even in a parallel world where history
is different, he suffers the same fate.

15:59.570 --> 16:00.720
True.

16:06.370 --> 16:07.960
Mr. da Vinci, what's the matter?

16:08.040 --> 16:12.250
Yasha, isn't it bad to let
Kobayakawa die like this?

16:12.790 --> 16:16.010
Yes. I will do whatever you wish.

16:21.220 --> 16:22.720
Dabinoji...

16:26.810 --> 16:28.940
How do I save this inept person?

16:29.100 --> 16:36.320
Master Takuan didn't tell me how to
revert loss of humanity to the gun demon.

16:36.900 --> 16:38.070
Musashi.

16:38.780 --> 16:39.970
Yes!

16:40.320 --> 16:45.490
People overcome by the demon lose
their humanity and die, is that correct?

16:46.120 --> 16:48.960
That's what I was told.
I also heard...

16:49.120 --> 16:56.460
about a certain general in a certain temple
that was betrayed by a certain lieutenant...

16:57.000 --> 17:02.190
who set fire to the temple.
He did not lose his humanity...

17:02.300 --> 17:04.890
after taking possession of the demon gun.

17:13.020 --> 17:14.690
The world belongs to me!

17:15.520 --> 17:18.030
I am the one who killed the Lord!

17:23.160 --> 17:27.040
As long as I have this gun, I'm invincible!

17:27.660 --> 17:29.710
I will unify the country!

17:38.010 --> 17:39.220
I am late!

17:39.590 --> 17:42.180
Lord <i>Hyuga no Kami</i>, what did you do?

17:48.720 --> 17:50.390
Go to hell, all of you!

18:10.330 --> 18:11.830
<i>Hyuga no Kami</i>?

18:12.000 --> 18:17.880
Musashi, was the man who held
the gun really called <i>Hyuga no Kami</i>?

18:18.300 --> 18:21.880
Yes, that's what Dabinoji said.

18:22.090 --> 18:29.680
Unbelievable. It was because of the gun that
Mitsuhide Akechi turned against Nobunaga Oda.

18:33.350 --> 18:36.900
What, <i>Hyuga no Kami</i> was Mitsuhide Akechi?

18:37.440 --> 18:38.610
What are you doing?

18:39.610 --> 18:41.510
I'm going to kill Hideaki Kobayakawa!

18:42.860 --> 18:47.700
He was a fellow warrior,
but he cannot be saved.

18:47.750 --> 18:51.870
I will kill him to save what is
left of his samurai dignity.

19:05.880 --> 19:07.330
Musashi, what are you doing?

19:07.430 --> 19:11.140
I don't like to see friends killing each other.

19:14.480 --> 19:15.610
Musashi!

19:15.770 --> 19:17.980
Yume, lend me your strength!

19:24.150 --> 19:26.860
Musashi, don't get in my way!

19:27.030 --> 19:29.320
I will kill Kobayakawa no matter what!

19:31.740 --> 19:36.580
I have my share of responsibility too!
I am the one who will kill Kobayakawa!

19:40.130 --> 19:45.050
Yume, now!
Protect me like before!

19:45.760 --> 19:46.930
Yes!

20:01.980 --> 20:03.820
He got the gun back!

20:05.530 --> 20:08.910
I didn't want to kill anyone, but whatever...

20:16.830 --> 20:18.020
Yasha?

20:18.170 --> 20:20.000
I'm taking this man with me.

20:20.210 --> 20:21.330
What?

20:44.230 --> 20:45.820
You're back.

20:46.280 --> 20:47.670
How is Kobayaka?

20:47.990 --> 20:50.570
He only lost consciousness.

20:51.870 --> 20:53.530
What do we do with him?

20:54.240 --> 20:56.160
I've got an idea, Yasha.

20:57.790 --> 21:02.670
Why don't you take us all to your base?

21:05.130 --> 21:12.840
In this age without industrial revolution, it's hard for me to create new contraptions.

21:13.430 --> 21:18.430
I believe it will be easier for you.

21:18.930 --> 21:20.310
Very well.

21:21.480 --> 21:26.070
Don't you wanna make him look more human?

21:26.900 --> 21:29.570
If Mr. da Vinci orders it...

22:00.640 --> 22:02.040
I've become human again!

22:03.310 --> 22:04.690
I am finally human!

22:04.860 --> 22:06.400
That's better.

22:07.230 --> 22:11.070
I will be able to bring gifts to Lord Ryogen.

22:15.820 --> 22:18.580
Mr. da Vinci, let's go.

22:19.330 --> 22:23.540
This will be the second
time you teleport me.

22:24.000 --> 22:26.170
Dabinoji, do not go there!

22:26.330 --> 22:29.630
You must not help the ayakashi!

22:30.090 --> 22:33.470
Sasuke Sarutobi, I've already told you.

22:33.630 --> 22:40.600
I would follow anyone for new
inventions, even an ayakashi!

22:40.770 --> 22:43.550
Our collaboration, though brief, has been pleasant.

22:56.530 --> 22:58.160
Dabinoji!

23:04.370 --> 23:06.170
Ninjataro, what are you doing here?

23:06.290 --> 23:08.420
Sasuke Sarutobi, is that you?

23:09.090 --> 23:10.420
Lord Yukimura Sanada!

23:11.130 --> 23:14.010
I must be out of the loop.
Isn't that Ninjataro?

23:14.220 --> 23:15.380
Musashi!

23:17.800 --> 23:19.890
That is Ninjataro!

23:20.060 --> 23:26.730
No, I am a servant of Lord Sanada, one of
the Sanada Ten Braves, Sasuke Sarutobi!

23:27.190 --> 23:29.190
Did you make a monkey noise?

23:29.860 --> 23:33.740
Yes, it was me, old Dabinoji's monkey!

23:34.070 --> 23:36.740
Old Dabinoji's monkey?

23:37.160 --> 23:43.290
Dabinoji... I mean Leonardo da Vinci, left with Yasha.

24:00.210 --> 24:02.960
In my natural, unadorned style,

24:02.960 --> 24:05.800
I'll tell you these feelings of mine

24:05.800 --> 24:11.140
Together to the sky past the darkness!

24:11.140 --> 24:16.270
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

24:17.810 --> 24:22.940
Baby, we'll send time flowing forward just a little,

24:22.940 --> 24:29.120
and we'll embrace even the harsh gusts of wind

24:29.120 --> 24:34.450
with sympathy for pointless worries

24:34.450 --> 24:38.580
and a melody that will overcome the pain

24:40.960 --> 24:51.350
If the poison of the flower that bloomed in my cupped hands

24:51.350 --> 25:02.270
has managed to pierce through the center of my heart...

25:02.270 --> 25:05.030
In my natural, unadorned style,

25:05.030 --> 25:07.900
I'll tell you these feelings of mine,

25:07.900 --> 25:13.490
Unraveling this puzzle of the heart

25:13.490 --> 25:16.250
I'll bring out every part

25:16.250 --> 25:19.250
of your unchanging style

25:19.250 --> 25:24.550
Together to the sky past the darkness!

25:24.550 --> 25:29.720
All we need to do is spread our wings and fly!

25:30.680 --> 25:33.560
Old Dabinoji has joined the enemy!

25:34.320 --> 25:37.120
And a ridiculously powerful ayakashi appeared!

25:37.560 --> 25:39.120
His name is...

25:39.320 --> 25:41.120
Huh? Really?

25:41.320 --> 25:44.630
The next chapter: <i>Soul Seal</i>!
